	(text "Charger and power path: BQ25180 (I2C 0x6A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6d54145-79f8-5566-a7a5-eff5b9867429")
	)
	(text "ILIM / ICHG (250 mA) / SYS_REG / ship mode set over I2C: register init per dial-me-spinner docs/firmware.md §13.1.\nIN 2.2u/25V X7R 0805, SYS 10u/25V, BAT 4.7u: each within 1 mm of its ball and of the D2 GND ball.\nShip mode exits only on a USB plug-in (TS/MR is not wired to a button in rev A).\n/INT -> CHG_INT_N (10k pull-up R8, GPIO3). RT1: 10k NTC next to J2 (board temperature, not the cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "53adbcd6-31be-5b78-9314-39694c1fca09")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 191.77 17.78)
		(end 342.9 100.33)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "7a1a7d4d-1495-5937-b731-f22cbaca3684")
	)
	(text "LiPo connector J2 (402535, ~500 mAh, JST-SH 2-pin)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 350.52 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8b8ca4d-5bcf-506c-a8e2-b877ac10fb3d")
	)
	(text "Pin 1 = BAT+, pin 2 = GND. Pack leads are not standardised: check every pack's polarity before plugging in.\nThe cell sits in the housing pocket behind the board (SPEC §2.1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 350.52 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b6425c0-b050-5d47-9280-a3dc4ac59826")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 347.98 17.78)
		(end 459.74 64.77)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "e7eea943-1c63-5cb9-a60d-af3d1357ed5a")
	)
	(text "3V3 buck-boost: TPS63802 (VSYS 2.5-4.6 V -> +3V3, 2 A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 107.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ffa8bf2d-f6af-5061-b299-89863a1b6f2a")
	)
	(text "Buck-boost, not an LDO: Wi-Fi TX peaks ~355 mA (module datasheet) and the cell falls below 3.4 V (SPEC §3).\nEN tied to VSYS (always on), MODE = GND (power save: 11 uA Iq), PG unused.\nR3/R4 = 511k/91k -> 3.31 V (VFB 0.5 V, TI Table 10-5); the divider draws 5.5 uA (R2 <= 100k rule).\nL1 DFE201612E-R47M (TI Table 10-2). CIN 10u + COUT 22u per Fig. 10-1, plus 22u bulk C6 for the RF bursts.\nLayout: VIN/VOUT caps and L1 on the same layer as U3, GND pad 8 to the plane with >= 2 vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8caf1c65-f76c-5bb5-8b37-ba7b60ae6161")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 12.7 105.41)
		(end 161.29 185.42)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "42251bcf-35f7-577b-abf5-b377c02e2f03")
	)
	(text "Fuel gauge: MAX17048 (I2C 0x36)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 107.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5866829b-629e-5a54-88bd-6bd0a58775b8")
	)
	(text "Powered from the cell (VDD = CELL = VBAT, Fig. 14). CTG, QSTRT and EP to GND. 3 uA in hibernate.\nALRT -> FG_ALRT_N (10k pull-up R9, GPIO2: low SOC / voltage alert)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8ec11e26-82ca-5901-bb40-37d574feef5f")
	)
