	(text "SDA/SCL 4.7k: BQ25180 0x6A, MAX17048 0x36, LIS2DW12 0x19 at 400 kHz (SPEC §6).\nMust stay on the always-on rail: the MAX17048 reads a low bus as 'disconnected' and sleeps."
